=== Floating Social Share Icons and Social Share buttons - Next Previous Post Links - FL ===
Contributors: DaNish Ali, freemius
Tags: social, sharing, sharing icons Pagination, Next Previous Post Links
Requires at least: 4.6
Tested up to: 6.6.2
Stable tag: 3.6.4
License: GPLv2 or later
License URI: http://www.gnu.org/licenses/gpl-2.0.html 
== Description ==

Displays social sharing icons along with fancy floating back to top and go to bottom links along with go to next post, previous post and random post links on post detail pages. Its tested and works with custom post types too.

Easy and free social media integration plugin to make your posts viral on the social network. It's highly customisable, professional and responsive. Demo. 

Engage your readers with style! 

<h3>Features:</h3>
1. Floating Social Sharing Icons or Buttons **New**.
1. Floating Next Post/Page Link.
1. Floating Previous Post/Page Link.
1. Floating Random Post/Page Link.
1. Floating Back to Top Link.
1. Floating Go to Bottom Link.
1. Floating Go to Home Link 
1. Primary and Secondary Bar 
1. Reorder the icons position 
1. Enable to navigate in same category 
1. Hide on load 
1. Show on % scroll from top
1. Fixed/float bar
1. Feature image on hover
1. Change Position
1. Minimizer and Maximizer 
1. Show Next and Previous Post Data On Hover
1. Show Copy Current URL icon 
1. Easy settings to show hide selected buttons.
1. Advanced design options.
1. Change colors in customizer and see changes **live**.
1. Select icons in customizer and see changes **live**. 
1. Change the font size of icons in customizer and see changes **live**. 
1. Dashicons and Fontawesome icons.
1. Works with any theme.
1. **More to come...** 

<h3>WANT TO SEE IT IN ACTION?</h3>
Check out the demo here ->[Demo](https://floskytech.com/pricing/)

<h3>HOW TO USE THE PLUGIN</h3>
Literally, you don't need to do anything. Just install and see the magic.

